      "date": "2026-02-17T12:22:22.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.82 (vs ₹0.10 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.82 (up from ₹0.10 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹734.9m (down 23% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹21.2m (up ₹18.7m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.9% (up from 0.3% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 35% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 99% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
